# Azure Learning Path: 10 Phases

Legend: **[IaC]** = deployed by `infra/main.bicep` | **[Lab]** = CLI lab in `labs/` | **COSTLY** = delete right after the lab

---

## Phase 1: Foundations (Day 1)
**Goal:** understand how Azure is organised and how you control access and cost.

| Service / concept | What it is | Where in CloudNotes |
|---|---|---|
| Tenant, Management Groups, Subscriptions | Org hierarchy: tenant > mgmt groups > subscriptions | Your free subscription |
| Resource Groups, Tags | Lifecycle container + metadata | `rg-cloudnotes-dev` [IaC] |
| Regions, Availability Zones | Geography and datacenter fault domains | `centralindia` / `southindia` pair |
| Azure Resource Manager (ARM) | The API behind portal/CLI/Bicep | Every deployment |
| Microsoft Entra ID | Identity: users, groups, apps, service principals | Phase 7 |
| Azure RBAC | Who can do what at which scope | [Lab] |
| Azure Policy | Enforce rules (allowed regions, required tags) | [Lab] |
| Resource Locks | Prevent accidental delete | [Lab] |
| Cost Management + Budgets | Spend analysis and alerts | [Lab] |
| Azure Advisor | Recommendations | Portal |

**Lab:** `labs/01-foundations.sh`
**Break it:** assign yourself Reader on the RG and try to create a storage account. Read the error.

