## Exam map
- **AZ-900** (fundamentals): Phases 1, 2, 3 overview, 5 overview, 7, 8
- **AZ-104** (administrator): Phases 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8
- **AZ-204** (developer): Phases 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 9
- **AI-102** (AI engineer): Phase 10

